      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → fal → fal Settings**.\n2. Describe the series in **Brief**. Start with how many you want, such as \"Generate 4 posters\".\n3. Press **Run**. Up to four posters are saved under `image/fal`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
