      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Model: Info** shows what fal says a model takes: each setting by fal's name, its choices, and its limits. It is free and needs no key. **Info** shows Seedream 5.0 lite. Copy the settings you want into a node's `arguments`, the model's own settings.\n\nSeedream has two counts. `num_images` makes separate images, and `max_images` lets one generation make up to that many related images. **Series** sets `max_images`, so the posters share one style."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
